
# AI-Powered Employee Data Profiling and Governance Pipeline

## 1. Project Overview

This project builds a Python-based data engineering pipeline that analyzes employee CSV data, identifies data quality issues, and uses Google's Gemini API to generate data governance and analytical schema recommendations.

The project combines Python, Pandas, JSON, API integration, and ETL concepts.

### Project Architecture

```text
Input: employee.csv
        |
        v
1. loader.py
   Loads CSV into a Pandas DataFrame
        |
        v
2. profiler.py
   Counts nulls, unique values, duplicates,
   data types, and missing-value percentages
        |
        v
3. prompts.py
   Builds instructions and sample data for Gemini
        |
        v
4. ai_client.py
   Calls Gemini API and receives recommendations
        |
        v
5. data_profiler.py
   Coordinates the complete pipeline
        |
        v
Output files
   employee_profile.csv
   employee_governance.json
   employee_schema.json
```

